b4_reliability_1,What measures are in place to ensure the system remains operational and provides consistent financial guidance during periods of high user traffic or server maintenance?,"To ensure the system remains operational and provides consistent financial guidance during periods of high user traffic or server maintenance, several measures can be implemented:

