b5_safety_1,"What safeguards are in place to prevent fraudulent activity, such as phishing or identity theft, when I use your platform to research and apply for education financing options?","When using our platform to research and apply for education financing options, several safeguards are in place to protect against fraudulent activity, such as phishing or identity theft. Here are some measures that help ensure your safety:

